{"id":"word:hebrew:H2148","type":"word","title":"זְכַרְיָה","subtitle":"H2148 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Zecarjah , the name of twenty-nine Israelites","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to זְכַרְיָה (H2148) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 43 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"זְכַרְיָה (Zᵉkaryâh) means Zecarjah , the name of twenty-nine Israelites First listed occurrence: 1Chr 5 7."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"זְכַרְיָה","transliteration":"Zᵉkaryâh","pronunciation":"zek-ar-yaw'","strong":"H2148","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2148","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-m","forms":["זְכַרְיָה֙","זְכַרְיָ֖ה","זְכַרְיָ֑ה","זְכַרְיָ֖הוּ","זְכַרְיָ֥ה"],"morphs":[["HNp",31],["HC/Np",8],["HC/R/Np",2],["AC/Np",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"Zecarjah , the name of twenty-nine Israelites","usage":"Zachariah, Zechariah.","full":"H2148. Zkaryah זְכַרְיָהוּ , oftener זְכַרְיָה proper name, masculine (Sabean ידֿכראל DHM Epigr. Denkm. 43 ) ᵐ5 Ζαχαρια ( ς ), etc.: — 1 זכריהו , king of Israel, son of Jeroboam II, 2Kin 15:8 = זכריה 14:29 ; 15:11 . 2 זכריהו , father of Hezekiah's mother 2Chr 29:1 = זכריה 2Kin 18:2 . 3 זכריהו , contemporary of Isaiah Isa 8:2 . 4 זכריהו , a Reubenite 1Chr 5:7 . 5 זכריה , a Benjamite 1Chr 9:37 ( ᵐ5 Ζαχαρια , A Ζαχχουρ ᵐ5 L Ζεχρει ) = זָ֑כֶר 8:31 (see [I. זֶכֶר ]). 6 זכריהו , a Manassite 1Chr 27:21 ( ᵐ5 Ζαβδειου , ᵐ5 L Ζαχαριου ). 7 זכריהו , a son of Jehoshaphat 2Chr 21:2 . 8 זכריה , a captain of Jehosh. 2Chr 17:7 . 9 זכריהו , teacher of Uzziah 2Chr 26:5 . 10 Levites , זכריהו : a. 1Chr 15:18 = זכריה 15:20 , 16:5 . b. 1Chr 24:25 . c. 1Chr 26:2 , 14 . d. 1Chr 26:11 . e. 2Chr 20:14 . f. 2Chr 29:13 ( ᵐ5 Ἀζαριας , A Ζαχαριας , so ᵐ5 L ). זכריה : g. 1Chr 9:21 . h. 2Chr 34:12 . i. an Asaphite Neh 12:35 . 11 priests , זכריהו : a. 1Chr 15:24 b. 2Chr 35:8 . זכריה : c. 2Chr 24:20 ( ᵐ5 Ἀζαριαν ; ᵐ5 L Ζαχαριαν ; probably referred to Matt 23:35 , where apparently confusion with f ). d. Neh 11:12 . e. Neh 12:41 . f. the well-known prophet Zech 1:1 , 7 ; 7:1 , 8 ; Neh 12:16 [compare Aramaic Ezra 5:1 ; 6:14 ]. 12 returned exiles , זכריה : a. Ezra 8:3 and perhaps 8:16 , compare Neh 8:4 . b. Ezra 8:11 ( ᵐ5 Ἀζαριας , A Ζαχαριας , so ᵐ5 L ). c. Ezra 10:26 . d. a man of Judah Neh 11:4 . e. id. Neh 11:5 ( ᵐ5 Θηζεια , א Θηδεια , A Ζαχαριου , so ᵐ5 L ). זְכַרְיָה proper name, masculine prophet (Biblical Hebrew id. ), Ezra 5:1 ; 6:14 .","rootNote":"or זְכַרְיָהוּ ; from 2142 and 3050 ; Jah has remembered;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 5 7","keyReferences":["1Chr 5 7","1Chr 9 21","1Chr 9 37","1Chr 15 18","1Chr 15 20","1Chr 15 24","1Chr 16 5","1Chr 24 25"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":43,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 5 7","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/זְכַרְיָֽהוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זְכַרְיָה֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 37","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":37,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/זְכַרְיָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זְכַרְיָ֡הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 20","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/זְכַרְיָ֨ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ֠/זְכַרְיָהוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זְכַרְיָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 24 25","book":"1Chr","chapter":24,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זְכַ